  "name": "TreQ",
  "description": "<p>TreQ is a frontier computing company accelerating the path to useful quantum computing. We design, deploy and operate open-architecture quantum computing infrastructure that evolves as quantum technologies advance.</p><p><br></p><p>Our open-architecture quantum (OAQ) approach delivers computing infrastructure designed to incorporate complementary quantum technologies as they mature. Rather than betting on a single quantum computing technology, pioneering technical leaders can rapidly adopt new quantum capabilities, driving innovation across the computing stack while protecting long-term infrastructure investments.</p><p><br></p><p>TreQ delivers and operates systems at customer premises and shared computing facilities, providing a trusted foundation for organizations to build quantum capability today while continuously incorporating future advances.</p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/treq-tech/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external\">LinkedIn</a> | <a href=\"https://treq.tech/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external\">Treq.tech</a></p><p><br><img title=\"TreQ Team\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://workablehr.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/photos/741515/26ba6a670226ba6357a330e3371405ca.jpg\"><br></p>",
